Subject: [PATCH 31/57] hw/misc: 8x8 R/Y/B and Button R/Y Clicks

The colour variants of the 8x8 G and Button G Clicks: the same circuits
in their v100 schematics (MAX7219 with LOAD on CS and no pull resistors;
pushbutton on INT with R3 10k to ground, LED on PWM). qtests for each.

Not checked against physical Clicks.

Peripheral Pretender: AI-assisted, not for upstream QEMU.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
